# ── junk / scratch drawer ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All throwaway scripts, model weights, screenshots, browser captures,
# test scaffolds, and scratch output live in junk/ and are NEVER committed.
# See root AGENTS.md rule 11 and this package's AGENTS.md §3.10.
junk/*
!junk/.gitkeep

# guard: if a weight/backup is dropped at package root by mistake, ignore it
*.pt
*.bin
*.onnx
*.bak
rife-ncnn-vulkan.bak
FastSAM*
# UI snaps mistakenly left next to app/ (prefer junk/<name>.png)
*_tab.png
*_run_state.png
Screenshot_*.png

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
